    script_en:
      "W: Ravi, I don't know if you've seen the numbers from last month. Unfortunately, our returns keep going up.\n\nM: Yes, and shoppers are leaving more complaints on our website too. Several mentioned the same issue.\n\nW: We need better ways to catch these problems ahead of time.\n\nM: Well, we could probably learn a lot from hikers who wear our boots on real trails. I was thinking maybe we could invite a few of them to test each design before we produce it.\n\nW: That sounds worth trying. Do you know anyone we could ask?\n\nM: I'll text you some names before lunch.",
