    script_en:
      "W: Hello. I'm calling to buy a copy of your paper from March of last year. My grandmother's garden was on the front page.\n\nM: Well, our back issues sell out within a month, but I can print you a full-size copy from our archives. I just need the exact date so I can look it up.\n\nW: It was the day after the spring flower show downtown.\n\nM: OK. Can you hold the line for a moment while I check?\n\nW: Sure. My family is putting together an exhibit for the town fair next month, and I'd like to display the page there.\n\nM: Oh! How nice.",
