      'A: Du lịch — Sai. Nội dung podcast không nói về du lịch. — Sai.\nB: Âm nhạc — Sai. Podcast không liên quan đến âm nhạc. — Sai.\nC: Sức khỏe — Sai. Chủ đề của chương trình không phải là sức khỏe. — Sai.\nD: Làm vườn — Đúng. Người nói giới thiệu đây là "a podcast all about gardening". — Đúng.',
    script_en:
      "Hello! Welcome to Green Hour—a podcast all about gardening for people with very little space. Before we get into today's episode, I want to correct something from last week's show: I gave the wrong address for the Riverside Plant Swap. The event is being held at 40 Palmer Street, not 14. My apologies for the confusion. All right, let's turn to today's guest. Ms. Ana Cortez is the owner of a seed company that supplies shops across the region. Under her leadership, the business has grown from a single stall into a well-known brand.",
