      "Hi. This is Owen from Marlow Bakery. I'm calling about our print order for discount cards. We originally asked to pick them up on Thursday, but we now need them ready by Tuesday instead. We just heard yesterday that our request to join the Harvest Market was accepted. It runs all weekend in Deerfield, and the cards would be ideal for the crowd we expect. Oh, one more thing—we'd also like to change the limit to four items on the card. Could you take care of that before you start printing? Thank you!",
