    passage_text:
      'Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.\nMerrow Lane Television Studios\nPriya Ansari, Director of Operations\nColin Beaumont, Studio Manager\nWelcome to Merrow Lane Television Studios! We are serious about maintaining a safe recording environment. We ask that the following rules be strictly observed while you are visiting the sound stages. Anyone found in violation of these rules will be asked to leave the premises. For concerns about compliance, please contact the studio manager.\nALWAYS:\nStay with your tour guide.\nWear the visitor badge issued at reception.\nRespond to alarm signals and obey evacuation instructions.\nRequest permission from your guide before taking photographs.\nNEVER:\nLeave your group.\nEnter areas marked “Restricted” or “Crew Only.”\nTouch lighting or camera equipment.',
    passage_html:
      '<p><b>Questions 151-152 refer to the following notice.</b></p><div><h2>Merrow Lane Television Studios</h2><p>Priya Ansari, Director of Operations<br>Colin Beaumont, Studio Manager</p><p>Welcome to Merrow Lane Television Studios! We are serious about maintaining a safe recording environment. We ask that the following rules be strictly observed while you are visiting the sound stages. Anyone found in violation of these rules will be asked to leave the premises. For concerns about compliance, please contact the studio manager.</p><p><b>ALWAYS:</b></p><ul><li>Stay with your tour guide.</li><li>Wear the visitor badge issued at reception.</li><li>Respond to alarm signals and obey evacuation instructions.</li><li>Request permission from your guide before taking photographs.</li></ul><p><b>NEVER:</b></p><ul><li>Leave your group.</li><li>Enter areas marked “Restricted” or “Crew Only.”</li><li>Touch lighting or camera equipment.</li></ul></div>',
    question: 'For whom is the notice most likely intended?',
    option_a: 'Camera operators',
    option_b: 'Security guards',
    option_c: 'Fire inspectors',
    option_d: 'Studio visitors',
